    "detail": "解：$\\because a$是最小的正整数，<br>$\\therefore a=1$；<br>$\\because b$是到原点的距离等于2的负数，<br>$\\therefore b=-2$；<br>$\\because c$是最大的负整数，<br>$\\therefore c=-1$．<br>$\\therefore a+b-c=1+(-2)-(-1)=1-2+1=0$．<br>故选：B．"
