    "stem": "小明在数学综合实践课后，设计了以下运算$xymn=xn-ym,‖x,y‖=3(x-y)$．若$M=\\begin{cases}a-2b  2a-b \\\\ a+2b  -a-2b\\end{cases}$，$N=‖a^{2},a‖$，且$M+N$的取值与a无关，则$M+N=$___________．",
    "options": [],
    "answer": "$6$",
