    "detail": "解：（1）由图可知：$AD=BC=20,AB=CD=a+3b=14$，<br>∴$S_{1}=3b\\times (AD-a)=3\\times 2\\times (20-8)=72$，$S_{2}=a\\times (BC-4b)=8\\times (20-8)=96$，<br>∴$S_{2}-S_{1}=96-72=24$；<br>故答案为：$24$；<br>（2）设$AD=x$，<br>则：$3S_{2}-5S_{1}=3a(x-4b)-5\\times 3b(x-a)$<br>$=3ax-12ab-15bx+15ab$<br>$=(3a-15b)x+3ab$；<br>∵$3S_{2}-5S_{1}$的值与$AD$的长度无关，<br>∴$3a-15b=0$，<br>∴$a=5b$；<br>故答案为：$a=5b$．"
