    "detail": "解：①当$E$在线段$BC$上时，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch13_1_q11_detail1.png\" data-cx=\"2000000\" data-cy=\"1392857\" style=\"width:210px;height:auto;margin:8px 0\" class=\"block\">$\\because \\angle ABC=30^\\circ$，$BD$平分$\\angle ABC$，$\\therefore \\angle ABP=\\frac{1}{2}\\angle ABC=15^\\circ$。<br>$\\because \\angle ACB=90^\\circ$，$\\therefore \\angle BAC=90^\\circ-30^\\circ=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle BAE=\\angle BAC-\\angle CAE=40^\\circ$。<br>$\\because AP$平分$\\angle BAE$，$\\therefore \\angle BAP=\\frac{1}{2}\\angle BAE=20^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle APB=180^\\circ-\\angle ABP-\\angle BAP=145^\\circ$；<br>②当$E$在$BC$的延长线上时，<br><img src=\"assets/images/ch13_1_q11_detail2.png\" data-cx=\"2000000\" data-cy=\"1392857\" style=\"width:210px;height:auto;margin:8px 0\" class=\"block\">$\\because \\angle ABC=30^\\circ$，$BD$平分$\\angle ABC$，$\\therefore \\angle ABP=\\frac{1}{2}\\angle ABC=15^\\circ$。<br>$\\because \\angle ACB=90^\\circ$，$\\therefore \\angle BAC=90^\\circ-30^\\circ=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle BAE=\\angle BAC+\\angle CAE=80^\\circ$。<br>$\\because AP$平分$\\angle BAE$，$\\therefore \\angle BAP=\\frac{1}{2}\\angle BAE=40^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle APB=180^\\circ-\\angle ABP-\\angle BAP=125^\\circ$。<br>综上所述，$\\angle APB=125^\\circ$或$145^\\circ$。<br>故选：C。"
