    "detail": "（1）证明：$\\because AP$平分$\\angle BAC$，$PD\\perp AB$，$PE\\perp AC$，<br>$\\therefore PD=PE$，<br>在$\\text{Rt}\\triangle ADP$和$\\text{Rt}\\triangle AEP$中，<br>$\\begin{cases} AP=AP \\\\ PD=PE \\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\text{Rt}\\triangle ADP\\cong\\text{Rt}\\triangle AEP(\\text{HL})$，<br>$\\therefore AD=AE$；<br>（2）解：在$\\text{Rt}\\triangle PDM$和$\\text{Rt}\\triangle PEN$中，<br>$\\begin{cases} PD=PE \\\\ PM=PN \\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\text{Rt}\\triangle PDM\\cong\\text{Rt}\\triangle PEN(\\text{HL})$，<br>$\\therefore DM=EN$，<br>$\\because AE+AD=AN+EN+AM-DM=AN+AM$，<br>$\\because AM=5$，$AN=3$，<br>$\\therefore AE+AD=8$，<br>$\\because AE=AD$，<br>$\\therefore AD=4$．"
