    "detail": "解：当点$P$在点$Q$左侧时，如图所示：<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_28ff2c42d699.png\" data-cx=\"2238375\" data-cy=\"1019175\" style=\"width:235px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>由垂直平分线性质可知$AP=BP, AQ=QC$，<br>∴$C_{\\triangle AQP}=AP+AQ+PQ=BP+QC+PQ=BC=10$；<br>当点$P$在点$Q$的右侧时，如图所示：<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_5f9909cde178.png\" data-cx=\"1876425\" data-cy=\"1295400\" style=\"width:197px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>由垂直平分线性质可知$AP=BP, AQ=QC$，<br>∴$C_{\\triangle AQP}=AP+AQ+PQ=BP+QC+PQ$<br>$=BP+CP+PQ+PQ$<br>$=BC+2PQ=10+4=14$；<br>综上所述，$\\triangle AQP$的周长为10或14，<br>故选：D．"
