    "detail": "解：$\\because \\angle ADM=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle CDN=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\because MN$垂直平分$BC$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle DEC=90^\\circ$，$BD=CD$，<br>∴$\\angle DBC=\\angle C=90^\\circ -60^\\circ =30^\\circ$，<br>∵$\\angle ABD=20^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ABC=\\angle ABD+\\angle DBC=50^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle A=180^\\circ -\\angle C-\\angle ABC=100^\\circ$，<br>故答案为：$100^\\circ$．"
