    "stem": "如图，在$\\triangle ABC$中，$EF$垂直平分$AC$，交$AC$于点F，交$BC$于点E，$AD\\perp BC$于点D，且$BD=DE$．若$AF=6$， $CD=10$，则$\\triangle ABC$的周长为_______<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_6f55a376ee34.png\" data-cx=\"1590675\" data-cy=\"1219200\" style=\"width:167px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\">",
