    "stem": "如图，将等边$\\triangle APQ$的边$PQ$向两边延长，使$PB=QC=PQ$，则$\\angle BAC$的度数为（   ）<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_b39cae793c01.png\" data-cx=\"2286000\" data-cy=\"952500\" style=\"width:240px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\">",
