    "detail": "解：连接$AE$，$AG$，如图所示，<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_03498fb99f7d.png\" data-cx=\"2505075\" data-cy=\"1247775\" style=\"width:263px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>∵$\\angle BAC=120^\\circ$，$AB=AC$，<br>∴$\\angle B=\\angle C=30^\\circ$，<br>∵$DE$，$GF$分别是$AB$，$AC$的中垂线，<br>∴$BE=AE,AG=CG$，<br>∴$\\angle B=\\angle EAB=30^\\circ ,\\angle C=\\angle GAC=30^\\circ$，<br>∴$\\angle EAG=\\angle BAC-\\angle EAB-\\angle GAC=120^\\circ -30^\\circ -30^\\circ =60^\\circ$，<br>在$\\triangle ABE$和$\\triangle ACG$中，<br>${\\begin{cases}\\angle B=\\angle C \\\\ \\angle EAB=\\angle GAC \\\\ AB=AC\\end{cases}$，<br>∴$\\triangle ABE\\cong \\triangle ACG$，<br>∴$AE=AG$，<br>∵$\\angle EAG=60^\\circ$，<br>∴$\\triangle AEG$是等边三角形，<br>∴$EG=AE=AG=BE=CG$，<br>∴$EG=\\frac{1}{3}BC=\\frac{1}{3}\\times 30=10$，<br>故答案为：$10$．"
