    "detail": "解：∵$\\triangle ABC$是等边三角形，点$D$是$AC$的中点，<br>∴$\\angle C=60^\\circ$，$AB=AC=2CD$，<br>∵$DE\\perp BC$，$CE=3$，<br>∴$\\angle DEC=90^\\circ$，<br>∴$\\angle CDE=90^\\circ -\\angle C=90^\\circ -60^\\circ =30^\\circ$，<br>∴$CD=2CE=2\\times 3=6$，<br>∴$AC=2CD=12$，<br>∴$AB=12$<br>故选：A．"
