    "detail": "解：由题意可得：<br>$S_{甲}=6\\times 2a\\times 2a+2\\times a\\times a=26a^{2}$，<br>$S_{乙}=6\\times 2a\\times 2a=24a^{2}$，<br>$S_{丙}=6\\times 2a\\times 2a+4\\times a\\times a=28a^{2}$，<br>$\\because 28a^{2}>26a^{2}>24a^{2}$，<br>$\\therefore S_{丙}>S_{甲}>S_{乙}$，<br>故选：B．"
