    "detail": "（1）解：如图，过点 $C$ 作 $CD\\perp x$ 轴于点 $D$：<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_wy_mid_q23_sol1.png\" data-cx=\"1609725\" data-cy=\"1181100\" style=\"width:160px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>$\\because \\angle AOB=90^{\\circ},\\angle BAC=90^{\\circ}$，$\\therefore \\angle CAD=\\angle ABO$，<br>在 $\\triangle DAC$ 和 $\\triangle OBA$ 中，$\\begin{cases}\\angle ADC=\\angle BOA=90^{\\circ} \\\\ \\angle CAD=\\angle ABO \\\\ AC=AB\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle DAC\\cong \\triangle OBA\\ (\\text{AAS})$，<br>$\\therefore AD=OB=6$，$DC=OA=3$，<br>$\\therefore OD=OA+AD=3+6=9$，故 $C(-9,-3)$；<br>（2）解：如图，过点 $D$ 作 $DH\\perp y$ 轴于点 $H$：<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_wy_mid_q23_sol2.png\" data-cx=\"1447800\" data-cy=\"1162050\" style=\"width:155px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>$\\because DE\\perp x$ 轴，$DH\\perp y$ 轴，$\\therefore OH=DE$，$OP-DE=OP-OH=PH$，<br>由同角余角相等得 $\\angle OAP=\\angle HPD$，<br>在 $\\triangle AOP$ 和 $\\triangle PHD$ 中，$\\begin{cases}\\angle AOP=\\angle PHD=90^{\\circ} \\\\ \\angle OAP=\\angle HPD \\\\ AP=PD\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle AOP\\cong \\triangle PHD\\ (\\text{AAS})$，<br>$\\therefore PH=OA=3$，即 $OP-DE=3$；<br>（3）解：如图，过点 $F$ 作 $FS\\perp x$ 轴于点 $S$，$FT\\perp y$ 轴于点 $T$：<br><img src=\"assets/images/g8_wy_mid_q23_sol3.png\" data-cx=\"1266825\" data-cy=\"1323975\" style=\"width:145px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>$\\because F(-3,-3)$，$\\therefore FS=FT=3$，$\\angle SFT=90^{\\circ}$，<br>$\\because \\angle GFH=90^{\\circ}$，$\\therefore \\angle SFH=\\angle TFG$，<br>在 $\\triangle HSF$ 和 $\\triangle GTF$ 中，$\\begin{cases}\\angle HSF=\\angle GTF=90^{\\circ} \\\\ FS=TF \\\\ \\angle SFH=\\angle TFG\\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle HSF\\cong \\triangle GTF\\ (\\text{ASA})$，<br>$\\therefore GT=SH$，<br>$\\because G(0,m)$，$H(n,0)$，且 $m>0,n<-3$，<br>$\\therefore SH=-(n)-3=-n-3$（或 $n+3=-m-3$），<br>$\\therefore m+n=-6$．",
