    "stem": "得益于南水北调，引黄入冀等工程，现在白洋淀的水位已经保持稳定。某水文站工作人员持续5天对白洋淀水位进行了5次检测，记录数据为7.05米、6.95米、7.1米、7.0米、6.9米。(1)计算这5天白洋淀的水位的平均高度。(2)用正数、负数和0表示出5天白洋淀水位的高度和平均高度相比的结果。<br><table class=\"w-full text-xs border-collapse border border-slate-300 my-2 bg-white\"><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">水位高度（米）</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">7.05</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">6.95</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">7.1</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">7.0</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">6.9</td></tr><tr><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">与平均水位高度相比（米）</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\">﹢0.05</td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\"></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\"></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\"></td><td class=\"border border-slate-300 px-2 py-1 text-center\"></td></tr></table>",
