    "detail": "（1）解：①$\\frac{x+1}{x}=\\frac{x}{x}+\\frac{1}{x}=1+\\frac{1}{x}$，<br>∴$\\frac{x+1}{x}$是“和谐分式”；<br>②$\\frac{x+2}{x^{2}}=\\frac{x}{x^{2}}+\\frac{2}{x^{2}}=\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{2}{x^{2}}$，无整式部分，<br>∴$\\frac{x+2}{x^{2}}$不是“和谐分式”；<br>③$\\frac{x+2}{x+1}=\\frac{x+1}{x+1}+\\frac{1}{x+1}=1+\\frac{1}{x+1}$，<br>∴$\\frac{x+2}{x+1}$是“和谐分式”；<br>④$\\frac{y^{2}+1}{y^{2}}=\\frac{y^{2}}{y^{2}}+\\frac{1}{y^{2}}=1+\\frac{1}{y^{2}}$，<br>∴$\\frac{y^{2}+1}{y^{2}}$是“和谐分式”；<br>综上所述，①③④是“和谐分式”；<br>（2）解：$\\frac{a^{2}−2a+3}{a−1}$<br>$=\\frac{a^{2}−2a+1−1+3}{a−1}$<br>$=\\frac{(a−1)^{2}+2}{a−1}$<br>$=\\frac{(a−1)^{2}}{a−1}+\\frac{2}{a−1}$<br>$=a−1+\\frac{2}{a−1}$；<br>（3）解：$\\frac{3x+6}{x+1}−\\frac{x−1}{x}÷\\frac{x^{2}−1}{x^{2}+2x}$<br>$=\\frac{3x+6}{x+1}−\\frac{x−1}{x}⋅\\frac{x(x+2)}{(x+1)(x−1)}$<br>$=\\frac{3x+6}{x+1}−\\frac{x+2}{x+1}$<br>$=\\frac{2x+4}{x+1}$<br>$=\\frac{2x+2+2}{x+1}$<br>$=\\frac{2(x+1)}{x+1}+\\frac{2}{x+1}$<br>$=2+\\frac{2}{x+1}$，<br>∵$\\frac{3x+6}{x+1}−\\frac{x−1}{x}÷\\frac{x^{2}−1}{x^{2}+2x}$的值为整数，<br>∴$2+\\frac{2}{x+1}$的值为整数，<br>∴$\\frac{2}{x+1}$的值为整数，<br>又∵x为整数，<br>∴$x+1=±2$或$x+1=±1$，<br>∴$x=−3$或$x=1$或$x=−2$或$x=0$，<br>又∵分式要有意义，<br>∴$x≠0$且$x+1≠0$且$x−1≠0$且$x+2≠0$，<br>∴$x≠0$且$x≠−1$且$x≠1$且$x≠−2$，<br>∴$x=−3$．",
